Subject: Packaging: normalize two file modes to 100644

Upstream marks exllamav3/model_init.py and exllamav3/architecture/solar_open_moe.py executable (100755). The
deployed tree has them as 100644 (it has no executable files at all). Mode change only. engine.sha256 and the
service's pins hash file content, so dropping this patch changes no hash.

diff --git a/exllamav3/architecture/solar_open_moe.py b/exllamav3/architecture/solar_open_moe.py
old mode 100755
new mode 100644
diff --git a/exllamav3/model_init.py b/exllamav3/model_init.py
old mode 100755
new mode 100644
